  "scope_notes": [
    "Small-pack permission applies only to elements linked to the named hazard category, not all label elements.",
    "Labels are not automatically edited or approved.",
    "Fold-out label requirements, soluble single-use packs, inner packs ≤10 ml, transport hazard equivalence, and pictogram art compliance are out of scope or require review.",
